# Per-run E2E logs live in the DEPLOYED bot tree now (owner's ruling, 2026-10-11):
# /sc-ai/BOTS/AtlantisOpenBW/E2E_LOGS, next to the bot that produced them. They are
# machine-local bulk and never enter this repo - `_AI/` holds only the summary verdict
# tables that reference them (_AI/e2e/README.md). Nothing to ignore here: the BOTS tree
# is outside the repository entirely.
# Macro datum chains are machine-local bulk (owner ruling 2026-10-23):
# _AI/WINE-MACRO-DATUMS.md stays in the working tree only, never enters
# git - per-game rows accumulate too fast to version. Committed history
# stays in the git log; new datum rows ride the next code commit only
# as NEXT.md conclusions, never as file versions.
_AI/WINE-MACRO-DATUMS.md
